{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S05-S09 有一段较集中地转向害怕自己不再被需要、被嫌弃的具体顾虑，容易把留不住亲密的痛楚收窄成对自身位置和价值的不安。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S05-S09 同样较集中地转向害怕被嫌弃、不再被需要，容易让具体的被需要感成为主线。\",\n    \"S13 把重心进一步推向索取永远不变的承诺以及自我保护；S14 则转向回顾自己从最初的紧张到如今敢于表达的成长，淡化了当下亲密幸福与它终将可能消逝之间的交织。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条线的主要情感材料和变化过程几乎完全相同，但 X 的 S14 明确把刚才的高兴与未来可能失去这份亲近放在同一个感受里，形成又甜又酸的不可分状态。Y 的结尾更多落在回顾自身变化和成长上，使主线稍微偏向学会坦然表达喜欢，而不是亲密的幸福与留不住它的痛楚本身。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0bc7861-9f59-4eda-8b66-44e80866dd2c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075408195766Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:54:27.345004+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "57f9d63768fbbd502c5d1d2ed25b417f3f3e9dba76ef9deb627a8e5f88c6c2f2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt